            <ArticleTitle>Preventive cardiology for coronary artery disease.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>15-38</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Primary and secondary risk factors and prevention strategies for coronary artery disease are reviewed. Cigarette smoking, hypertension, dyslipidemia, heredity, diabetes mellitus, obesity, beta blockades, and coronary artery bypass surgery are some of the topics discussed.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
